@startuml
title UC02 - Trình tự Đăng nhập hệ thống
actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Flutter UI" as UI
participant "AuthService (client)" as AuthSvc
participant "ApiService (client)" as Api
participant "AuthController (server)" as AuthCtrl
participant "UserService (server)" as UserSvc
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> UI: Nhập email/mật khẩu
UI -> AuthSvc: validate(credentials)
AuthSvc -> Api: POST /auth/login
Api -> AuthCtrl: /auth/login
AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: verifyCredentials(email, pwdHash)
UserSvc -> DB: SELECT user WHERE email
DB --> UserSvc: user + pwdHash
UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: hợp lệ?
AuthCtrl -> AuthCtrl: generate JWT/session
AuthCtrl --> Api: 200 + token
Api --> AuthSvc: token
AuthSvc -> UI: save token
UI --> User: Điều hướng Home

alt Sai thông tin
  AuthCtrl --> Api: 401
  Api --> AuthSvc: error
  AuthSvc -> UI: Hiển thị lỗi
end
@enduml